WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.140
Social organizations do enormous work in the field.

2
00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:11.250
But the data gets lost between paper forms, Excel versions and endless month-end closings.

3
00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:18.880
TecnoRestart MEAL connects the whole cycle: from field registration to the donor report, with the evidence behind every number.

4
00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:21.509
Let’s see it in action.

5
00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:29.410
In the field there is not always signal. For the system, that is not a problem.

6
00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:33.510
The field worker takes a photo of the signed attendance list.

7
00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:39.100
Artificial intelligence straightens it, reads it and checks it against the declared totals.

8
00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:47.610
Before saving, the phone checks whether each person was already served. Offline, and without storing names on the device.

9
00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:52.070
Everything stays on the phone, with date, time and location.

10
00:00:52.269 --> 00:00:58.059
When the signal comes back, it uploads by itself. If it retries, nothing is duplicated.

11
00:00:58.260 --> 00:01:02.420
The coordination team reviews, corrects if needed and approves.

12
00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:09.010
And the monthly dashboard updates: new people, progress against target and the source of every figure.

13
00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:13.010
From the field to the dashboard, without typing anything twice.

14
00:01:17.170 --> 00:01:22.630
End of the month. The cluster is waiting for the 345W matrix.

15
00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:27.570
Without copying or pasting a single figure. Watch the clock.

16
00:01:27.770 --> 00:01:34.020
Under Reports, open the 345W Platform, pick the month and press Export.

17
00:01:34.220 --> 00:01:40.160
The system takes only the new people in each activity, already audited and deduplicated.

18
00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:48.270
It validates all 67 columns of the OCHA template: geographic codes, coordinates and 18 sex and age brackets.

19
00:01:48.470 --> 00:01:53.690
If something does not add up, the export is blocked and tells you exactly what is missing.

20
00:01:53.890 --> 00:01:59.250
Artificial intelligence suggests the mapping. You decide.

21
00:01:59.449 --> 00:02:05.990
Export again: 92 rows, 1,247 people, zero errors.

22
00:02:06.190 --> 00:02:11.240
The Excel file comes out in the platform import format, ready to upload.

23
00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:17.670
Under a minute. This month’s 345W, ready for the cluster.

24
00:02:21.839 --> 00:02:25.809
Now, the monthly narrative report for the donor.

25
00:02:26.010 --> 00:02:32.070
The month checklist turns green: month closed, no rejections and targets loaded.

26
00:02:32.269 --> 00:02:34.559
One click on Draft.

27
00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:43.459
The system writes the figures from the database. Artificial intelligence drafts only the analysis, based on the coordination reports.

28
00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:49.960
Every sentence cites the passage it comes from, and a checker rejects any invented number or name.

29
00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:54.470
Nine out of nine sections, ready in just over a minute.

30
00:02:54.670 --> 00:03:01.980
With sections pending, the system will not let you approve. You review, adjust whatever you want and approve.

31
00:03:02.179 --> 00:03:05.499
Add the budget and the annex photos.

32
00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:09.810
And download the Word file, built on the donor’s official template.

33
00:03:10.010 --> 00:03:16.880
Approved reports become the style model for the following months. The monthly report, in one click.

34
00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:30.310
Security designed for sensitive data: two-step verification, a log that cannot be erased and gender-based violence data that no role sees by default.

35
00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:35.320
16 roles, including a read-only donor auditor.

36
00:03:35.519 --> 00:03:39.559
Try it for one month, with every module included.

37
00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:46.109
Message us on WhatsApp or at tecnorestart.com. We will show you your own project inside.
